In my current Tourist game I'm twoweaponing Grayswandir and another
silver saber.  I used two hits from the PYEC to charge up a ring of
increase damage to +6.  When I reached Orcus, I dispatched him in two
hits, before he could attack me even once or burn any charges from his
wand of death, the first I had encountered.

That was SWEET.  Even moreso since in the last game where I got to
him, he quickly summoned Demogorgon, who promptly killed me.

The only downside to the whole situation is that I had to burn three
wishes from the Castle wand to get Grayswandir.  (I really, really
wanted it.)  But I hadn't previously wished for any other artifacts,
or gotten one from sacrificing; the only one I'd seen in the game
previously was my own quest artifact.  I suppose some random monster
must have been generated with one, and I just didn't notice.


